Package: erhai-audio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: wireplumber (>= 0.5.13-1ubuntu1.1), alsa-ucm-conf (>= 1.2.4), alsa-utils, python3
Breaks: erhai-kernel (<< 0.3.0~)
Description: OnePlus Pad 2 Pro (erhai) audio topology and configuration
 Device-specific AudioReach topology built from pinned upstream sources.
 The HiFi profile provides the two internal microphones; DisplayPort audio
 is disabled by default.
 .
 The internal speakers are available by default at the stock amplifier
 level of -2.5 dB. erhai-audio-speaker disable persistently withdraws them.
 The stock DSP speaker protection and tuning are not implemented; the
 amplifier chip protections do not replace excursion and voice-coil
 temperature control. USB headset support is still under development.
